# Optional Python dependencies for Alis
#
# Core runtime (Material You color extraction, thumbnail generation, region
# detection, cover color extraction, Gowall effects, and image operations) is
# handled natively by Alis's compiled Rust binaries (alis-theme & alis-native)
# and requires NO Python virtual environment or `uv`.
#
# AI wallpaper cutout effects (`wallfx`) manage their own isolated opt-in venv
# when explicitly enabled by the user.
